      "writtenOn": "2024-05-21T00:11:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "New APIs in liblog are annotated with the availability. So, the caller (the test) must have used the `__builtin_available` guard when using them, so that they can run on older platform where the API is not available.",
