      "writtenOn": "2024-05-21T00:21:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, the commit message for aosp/1262822 makes it clearer:\n\n\u003e resolv tests got symbol missing problem for R MTS on Q devices.\n\u003e because libbase needs the new R symbols of liblog,\n\u003e which means liblog can\u0027t be statically link.\n\nThe wording is confusing to me -- I think it\u0027s saying that because we must link libbase statically, we must also link liblog statically, because some logging-related parts of libbase require a newer version of liblog.\n\nIs libbase required to work with old versions of liblog?",
      "parentUuid": "62fe5d9a_d68f5168",
